[center][color=#e6b85c][b]EMPLOYEE NAMES AND REFRESH[/b][/color][/center]

[b]What it does[/b]
Employee Names and Refresh is a standalone utility mod for Travellers Rest. It can refresh the available staff candidates, replace their generated names with an optional language-specific name pool, and resize or reposition the staff hiring window.

It is independent from Travellers Rest Translation Loader. You can install either mod on its own, or use both together.

[b]Highlights[/b]
[list]
[*][color=#d9ead3]Refresh[/color] candidates with the button in the staff hiring window or a configurable F6 hotkey.[/*]
[*][color=#d9ead3]Keep it non-cheaty[/color] with an optional daily Refresh limit.[/*]
[*][color=#d9ead3]Use names from a language pool[/color] without changing the rest of the game UI.[/*]
[*][color=#d9ead3]Switch name files live[/color]; the open candidate list refreshes automatically.[/*]
[*][color=#d9ead3]Resize and reposition[/color] the staff window for smaller displays or high-DPI setups.[/*]
[*][color=#d9ead3]Arabic right-to-left name support.[/color][/*]
[/list]

[b]Included name pools[/b]
Arabic, Bulgarian, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Polish, Russian, Turkish, and Ukrainian.

[b]Quick start[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Open the Staff menu and choose a profession tab.[/*]
[*]Use [b]Refresh[/b], or press [b]F6[/b], to generate a new set of candidates.[/*]
[*]Optional: install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/travellersrest/mods/95]Mod Config Menu[/url] to change the name pool, hotkey, Refresh limit, button spacing, and window layout in-game.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Requirements[/b]
[list]
[*]Travellers Rest for Windows.[/*]
[*][url=https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx/releases/tag/v5.4.21]BepInEx 5.4.21 x64[/url], or a compatible BepInEx 5 installation.[/*]
[/list]

[b]Installation[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Install BepInEx in the folder containing [b]TravellersRest.exe[/b], then start the game once.[/*]
[*]Extract this archive into Travellers Rest's [b]Windows[/b] folder.[/*]
[*]The mod files will be placed in [b]BepInEx\plugins\EmployeeRefresh[/b].[/*]
[*]Start the game. Its configuration file is created at [b]BepInEx\config\actepukc.travellersrest.employee-refresh.cfg[/b].[/*]
[/list]

[b]Name pools and UI language[/b]
Choose an included file with [b]EmployeeNamesFile[/b], then set [b]EnableNameOverrides=true[/b] to use its generated employee names. The selected file reloads immediately.

Every name file also contains the labels for the mod's Refresh controls. This means the Refresh button can use the selected language even when [b]EnableNameOverrides=false[/b]. Arabic employee names are formatted right-to-left automatically; this changes only the names, not the game's interface direction.

[b]Refresh and daily limit[/b]
Set [b]EnableCandidateRefresh=false[/b] if you only want name pools or the larger window; it removes both the Refresh button and F6.

[b]RefreshLimitPerDay=0[/b] means unlimited Refresh. Set it to a positive value such as [b]1[/b] or [b]2[/b] to limit manual button/F6 Refresh uses per in-game day. The button shows the used limit and becomes unavailable until the next day. Changing the selected name file does not use a daily Refresh.

[b]Window layout[/b]
Use [b]HeightMultiplier[/b] and [b]VerticalOffset[/b] under the Window settings to adjust the staff window. For the vanilla layout, use [b]HeightMultiplier=1[/b] and [b]VerticalOffset=0[/b].

[b]Adding a language or name pool[/b]
Copy a bundled [b]employee-names.*.txt[/b] file from [b]BepInEx\plugins\EmployeeRefresh\translations[/b], rename it, and select it with [b]EmployeeNamesFile[/b].

Each file contains male and female first-name sections. Languages with gendered family names can use separate male and female surname sections; languages such as Italian can instead use one shared surname section.

The [b][UI][/b] section contains [b]RefreshButton[/b], [b]RefreshRemaining[/b], and [b]RefreshAvailableTomorrow[/b]. Translate those values to localize the mod controls.

[b]Notes[/b]
Keep first names and surnames short for the best fit in staff cards and dialogs—preferably up to 8–9 characters, though the usable length depends on the script and glyph width. The mod warns about unusually long name parts but does not silently truncate them.

[b]Contributing[/b]
You can contribute a new name pool through a [url=https://github.com/AcTePuKc/travellers-rest-translation-mod/pulls]GitHub pull request[/url], or publish and maintain a separate pool on Nexus.

[b]Source and issues[/b]
Source code, release notes, and issue tracking are available on [url=https://github.com/AcTePuKc/travellers-rest-translation-mod]GitHub[/url].
